Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), python3 (<< 3.14), python3-venv, chrony, linuxptp, ethtool, iproute2, openssl, polkitd, util-linux-extra
Recommends: pci.ids
Homepage: https://github.com/BRCook/dante-virgil
Description: PTPv2 clocking for Dante over wireless links
 Virgil runs on a group of identical Clock Boxes, which find each other, elect
 a leader and serve PTP to their local Dante devices, bridging Dante across a
 wireless link.